                  </div>
                  <p>
                    <strong>Block-diagram placeholder:</strong> measured command range → normalisation → candidate models → residual comparison → held-out prediction.
                  </p>
                  <p>
                    <a class="template-link" href="./assets/images/motors/generate_motor_nonlinearity_plots.py" download="generate_motor_nonlinearity_plots.py">Download the Python and Seaborn source used to generate Figures 4a and 4b</a>
